# Archer's native checks by parity: #112 Seeking Arrow, #113 Hippogryph Ride and Call/Dive.
# Archer a against Archer b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero archer
# #112: the seeking arrow hits a standing b.
60 a stick 1 0
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
# #112 counterplay: b full-jumps the second arrow.
220 a stick 1 0
220 a tap X 2
221 a stick 0 0
230 b tap B 8
# #112 counterplay: b's held shield blocks the third.
380 b shield 1
390 a stick 1 0
390 a tap X 2
391 a stick 0 0
460 b shield 0
# #113: the ride, steered back over the stage, and a leap off on its 21st frame.
540 a stick 0 1
540 a tap X 2
541 a stick -0.6 0.6
560 a tap B 2
561 a stick 0 0
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
600 a press VIEW
670 a release VIEW
# #113: Hippogryph Call to a perch, then its dive.
760 a stick 0 -1
760 a tap X 2
761 a stick 0 0
820 a stick 0 -1
820 a tap X 2
821 a stick 0 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 60 special 2 form 0
#! expect b 85 damage 3.000
#! expect a 220 special 2 form 0
#! expect b 233 applied jump
#! absent b 86-379 damage
#! expect a 390 special 2 form 0
#! absent b 380-470 damage
#! expect a 540 special 4 form 0
#! expect a 560 special 0 form 0 action-frame 0 x 23.160 z 200.000
#! expect a 760 special 3 form 0
#! expect a 820 special 3 form 1
#! scene a HippoGryph
#! scene a MoonPriestessMissile
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
